Title: The Muppet Show
Credit: written by
Author: Liam Dunstan



INT. STAGE (CLASSROOM)

The curtains open on the stage. 

The stage is decorated like a classroom, a chalk board in the background and are 3 podiums in the foreground across the stage. Behind each podium is a character, Fozzie Bear, Quinta, Swedish Chef. 

At a separate table sits Sam the Eagle, the adjudicator of this spelling bee. 

SAM THE EAGLE
Welcome to the first ever ‘Muppet Show’ Spelling Bee. Today we will test the ability their abilities to spell, for every word they get wrong they will be given a spicy chili, and then for every word right after that, they can be given a glass of milk. Starting first with the bear. 

A bright light shoots at Fozzie Bear.

SAM THE EAGLE
Bear. Please spell “Hat”.

Fozzie leans over to the microphone

FOZZIE BEAR
UH, Hat : H - A - T

SAM THE EAGLE
Ah Very good. 

The audience and other contestants clap. The stage light turns off. 

FOZZIE BEAR
Ah, Waka-Waka.

SAM THE EAGLE
Now you Chef.

Once again the light turns off of Quinta and turns on brightly at Swedish Chef. Who is mixing a giant pot.

SAM THE EAGLE
Chef, spell “Chicken“

Chef pulls out a live chicken from the pot. 

SWEDISH CHEF
Bicken: Flurgy Burgy Burgen. 

SAM THE EAGLE 
That is correct. 

SWEDISH CHEF
Oh blurgy dergy.

Swedish Chef celebrates by throwing the chicken back into the pot and keeps stirring.

Quinta Brunson awkwardly claps. 

SAM THE EAGLE
Next Ms. Brunson.

The stage light turns on directly at Quinta. 

QUINTA BRUNSON
Oh, that is quite bright, can we - maybe get that turned down.

Sam the Eagle ignores her. 

SAM THE EAGLE
Ms. Brunson, please spell “Brachiation“

QUINTA
Oh ah? - Can I have its definition?

SAM THE EAGLE
Movement through swinging arms from one hold to another. 

QUINTA BRUNSON
Um - B-r-a-c-k-i-a-t-i-o-n

Sam the eagle looks down at his page and back up at Quinta Brunson.

SAM THE EAGLE
Unfortunately that is wrong. 

Sam the Eagle slams a big red button on the desk, which sounds an alarm. This is followed by Gonzo in an overly shiny silver dress, roller skates onto the stage holding a tray of Muppet chilis complete with eyes and mouth. 

GONZO
Ms. Brunson, your chili.

QUINTA BRUNSON
Thank you Gonzo.

Quinta takes a bite of the chili and is immediately out of breath. 

QUINTA BRUNSON
Oh gosh. I need - this is so hot. 
